    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1046">

                <pb facs="0907" n="791" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg791"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/14246.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Vice Consul Simpich to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Nogales</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-01-20">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 20, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Carrancistas have evacuated Nacozari which town now occupied by Maytorenistas;
                    Cabral’s troops not yet arrived from Chihuahua. Cabral going Cananea tomorrow;
                    Maytorena remains here; local conditions quiet.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Simpich.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
